<section class="section on-light" id="eligibility" aria-labelledby="elig-title">
    <div class="wrap elig-grid">
        <div>
            <h1 class="elig-title reveal" id="elig-title">Student at an Abia institution? <span class="hl">You can apply.</span></h1>
            <p class="elig-copy reveal d1">The programme is open to students at any institution in Abia State. If you&apos;re a student with a startup idea, or something you&apos;ve already started building, this is for you.</p>
            <div class="needs reveal d2">
                <h3>What you&apos;ll need for the application</h3>
                <ol>
                    <li>
                        <span class="need-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="8" r="4"></circle><path d="M4 21c0-4 3.6-7 8-7s8 3 8 7"></path></svg></span>
                        <div><strong>Your details</strong><span>Contact information, your institution and what you study</span></div>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <span class="need-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M9 18h6M10 21h4M12 3a6 6 0 0 0-3.5 10.9c.6.4 1 1.1 1 1.8V16h5v-.3c0-.7.4-1.4 1-1.8A6 6 0 0 0 12 3Z"></path></svg></span>
                        <div><strong>Your startup</strong><span>The problem you&apos;re solving, your solution and how far along you are</span></div>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <span class="need-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 12h4l3-8 4 16 3-8h2"></path></svg></span>
                        <div><strong>Your mentorship needs</strong><span>Where you want help, and what you hope to achieve in 6 weeks</span></div>
                    </li>
                </ol>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="checker reveal d1" id="checker">
            <svg class="checker-bg" viewBox="0 0 200 200" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="50" y="50" width="100" height="100" rx="10" transform="rotate(45 100 100)" fill="none" stroke="#FFFFFF" stroke-width="2"></rect><rect x="72" y="72" width="56" height="56" rx="6" transform="rotate(45 100 100)" fill="#111638"></rect></svg>
            <h3>Check in two taps</h3>
            <p>Answer two quick questions to see if you can apply.</p>
            <fieldset class="q"><legend>Are you currently a student?</legend><div class="q-opts"><button class="q-btn" type="button" id="elig-student-yes" data-q="student" data-v="yes" aria-pressed="false">Yes</button><button class="q-btn" type="button" id="elig-student-no" data-q="student" data-v="no" aria-pressed="false">No</button></div></fieldset>
            <fieldset class="q"><legend>Is your institution in Abia State?</legend><div class="q-opts"><button class="q-btn" type="button" id="elig-abia-yes" data-q="abia" data-v="yes" aria-pressed="false">Yes</button><button class="q-btn" type="button" id="elig-abia-no" data-q="abia" data-v="no" aria-pressed="false">No</button></div></fieldset>
            <div class="elig-result" id="elig-result" aria-live="polite"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"></circle><path d="M12 8v4M12 16h.01"></path></svg><p>Answer both questions to see your result.</p></div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
